  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- .NET 10: a net10.0-windows build beside the .NET Framework 4.8 build\n- Close() ends the browser and its driver; Release() hands a browser to another program\n- A selector string is read as CSS or XPath and searched as that one alone\n- Archives open like folders: zip, 7z, rar, tar, gz, bz2, xz; SaveTo writes zip, gz, tar and 7z\n- GPAL.Notify sends to Slack, Teams, Discord, Google Chat, Telegram, ntfy or any webhook\n- Clipboard in and out on browsers and applications; applications wait and match like browsers\n- Converter: any format converts to any other without losing data\n- Full list: https://github.com/SoftwareDecisionsInc/GPAL/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
